# Statue 468
# Simple statue with pedestal and torch eyes
# Origin is the player's position (~ ~ ~) when running the function.

fill ~0 ~0 ~0 ~4 ~0 ~4 cut_sandstone
fill ~1 ~1 ~1 ~3 ~2 ~3 sandstone
fill ~2 ~3 ~2 ~2 ~7 ~2 chiseled_sandstone
setblock ~1 ~5 ~2 chiseled_sandstone
setblock ~3 ~5 ~2 chiseled_sandstone
fill ~1 ~8 ~1 ~3 ~9 ~3 sandstone
setblock ~1 ~9 ~2 torch
setblock ~3 ~9 ~2 torch
say 🗿 Statue 468 complete!
